---
import Cite from './Cite.astro';
---

<div class="grpc-timeline">
  <ol role="list" aria-label="Selected RPC and gRPC milestones">
    <li>
      <time datetime="1976-01-14">1976</time>
      <span>
        RFC 707 describes a procedure-call model for invoking operations on remote hosts.
        <Cite id="rpc-rfc707" author="White, J. E." year="1976" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="1984-02">1984</time>
      <span>
        Birrell and Nelson publish <em>Implementing Remote Procedure Calls</em>.
        <Cite id="rpc-birrell-nelson" author="Birrell, A. & Nelson, B. J." year="1984" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2015-02-26">2015</time>
      <span>
        Google open-sources gRPC with HTTP/2 transport.
        <Cite id="grpc-introduction" author="Marculescu, M." year="2015" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2016-08-23">2016</time>
      <span>
        gRPC 1.0 is released with a stable core protocol and APIs for production use.
        <Cite id="grpc-1-0" author="Talwar, V." year="2016" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2017">2017</time>
      <span>
        gRPC joins the Cloud Native Computing Foundation (CNCF).
        <Cite id="grpc-cncf" author="Woods, N." year="2017" />
      </span>
    </li>
    <li>
      <time datetime="2018-10-23">2018</time>
      <span>
        gRPC-Web becomes generally available for browser clients.
        <Cite id="grpc-web-ga" author="Perkins et al." year="2018" />
      </span>
    </li>
  </ol>
</div>

<style>
  .grpc-timeline {
    --year-width: 4.5rem;
    --milestone-gap: 2.5rem;
    --track-position: 5.75rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .grpc-timeline ol {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .grpc-timeline li {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: var(--year-width) minmax(0, 1fr);
    column-gap: var(--milestone-gap);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 0 2rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .grpc-timeline li::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.8rem;
    bottom: -0.8rem;
    left: var(--track-position);
    width: 1px;
    background: var(--border-secondary);
  }

  .grpc-timeline li::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.8rem;
    left: var(--track-position);
    width: 0.625rem;
    height: 0.625rem;
    border: 2px solid var(--text-primary);
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--bg-primary);
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  }

  .grpc-timeline li:last-child {
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .grpc-timeline li:last-child::before {
    display: none;
  }

  .grpc-timeline time {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.28;
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .grpc-timeline span {
    max-width: 48ch;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .grpc-timeline {
      --year-width: 3rem;
      --milestone-gap: 2rem;
      --track-position: 4rem;
    }

    .grpc-timeline time {
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
  }
</style>
